The ggumap package bundles the following Rust crates (in src/rust/vendor.tar.xz).
Listed are the crate name, version, licence, and authors as declared by each crate.

The UMAP and NNDescent implementations (crates `umap` and `nndescent`) are
Copyright (c) 2025 Apple Inc., MIT licence, from https://github.com/apple/embedding-atlas.

- autocfg 1.5.1 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT): Josh Stone <cuviper@gmail.com> <https://github.com/cuviper/autocfg>
- bytemuck 1.25.2 (Zlib OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT): Lokathor <zefria@gmail.com> <https://github.com/Lokathor/bytemuck>
- cfg-if 1.0.5 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): Alex Crichton <alex@alexcrichton.com> <https://github.com/rust-lang/cfg-if>
- crossbeam-deque 0.8.8 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-deque developers <https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam>
- crossbeam-epoch 0.9.21 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-epoch developers <https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam>
- crossbeam-utils 0.8.23 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-utils developers <https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam>
- either 1.19.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The either developers <https://github.com/rayon-rs/either>
- extendr-api 0.9.0 (MIT): The extendr-api developers <https://github.com/extendr/extendr>
